    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 1
    choices: []
  - speaker: 'Francois '
    text: "\xBFPara comprar pan? "
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: 749445152557612188, guid: 8626c246a03ffbf4da7e963b1bf26a69, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 0
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 1
    soundClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd8dced5c1745ab4fa4203825aa83b89, type: 3}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: 
    text: "pregunt\xE9 curioso.\r\n"
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: 749445152557612188, guid: 8626c246a03ffbf4da7e963b1bf26a69, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 1
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 0
    soundClip: {fileID: 0}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: 
    text: "Elodie solo pudo asentir en silencio mientras apretaba la mand\xEDbula."
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: -1087421258012235777, guid: c2d09e26aef54fc4884531ebf704c0fd, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 1
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 0
    soundClip: {fileID: 0}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: Elodie
    text: "Ni siquiera alcanz\xF3 para uno entero."
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: -1087421258012235777, guid: c2d09e26aef54fc4884531ebf704c0fd, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 0
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 1
    soundClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b86074ec92355cd4d81fd67ee9c6fb62, type: 3}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: 
    text: "Frunc\xED el ce\xF1o con evidente decepci\xF3n, la situaci\xF3n en Par\xEDs
      estaba cada vez m\xE1s dif\xEDcil. Sin embargo, las fiestas de los reyes segu\xEDan,
      incluso me atrevo a decir que cada vez m\xE1s extravagante.\r\n"
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: -1087421258012235777, guid: c2d09e26aef54fc4884531ebf704c0fd, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 1
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 0
    soundClip: {fileID: 0}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 1
    choices: []
  - speaker: 'Francois '
    text: "Hay rumores de que la gente desea\u2026 una revoluci\xF3n. \xBFCrees que
      sea posible? "
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: -1087421258012235777, guid: c2d09e26aef54fc4884531ebf704c0fd, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 0
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 1
    soundClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd8dced5c1745ab4fa4203825aa83b89, type: 3}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd8dced5c1745ab4fa4203825aa83b89, type: 3}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: 
    text: "pregunt\xE9 en voz baja, sin estar muy convencido del todo.\r\n"
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: 749445152557612188, guid: 8626c246a03ffbf4da7e963b1bf26a69, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 1
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 0
    soundClip: {fileID: 0}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: 
    text: "No ten\xEDa una opini\xF3n exacta. Tal solo cre\xEDa injusto que el pan
      costara casi todas mis monedas, mientras la nobleza y el clero, que pose\xEDan
      m\xE1s recursos, no deb\xEDan pagar una moneda."
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: -1087421258012235777, guid: c2d09e26aef54fc4884531ebf704c0fd, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 1
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 0
    soundClip: {fileID: 0}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: Elodie
    text: "\xA1Espero que s\xED! \xA1No dudar\xE9 en revelarme contra ellos! \r\n"
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: -279528177590649484, guid: a43165c25c2222c4f916d608d276ce9e, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 0
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 1
    soundClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b86074ec92355cd4d81fd67ee9c6fb62, type: 3}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: 
    text: "murmur\xF3 molesta."
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: -1087421258012235777, guid: c2d09e26aef54fc4884531ebf704c0fd, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 1
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 0
    soundClip: {fileID: 0}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: Francois
    text: "Dudo que tu padre est\xE9 de acuerdo, Elodie.\r\n"
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: -1087421258012235777, guid: c2d09e26aef54fc4884531ebf704c0fd, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 0
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 1
    soundClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd8dced5c1745ab4fa4203825aa83b89, type: 3}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: Elodie
    text: "\xA1No me interesa! Mi padre est\xE1 acostumbrado a la monarqu\xEDa, a
      pesar de que viene as\xED hace a\xF1os. \xA1La situaci\xF3n empeora cada vez
      m\xE1s! Tenemos que hacer algo, "
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: -279528177590649484, guid: a43165c25c2222c4f916d608d276ce9e, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 0
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0.4
    shakeIntensity: 3
    playSound: 1
    soundClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b86074ec92355cd4d81fd67ee9c6fb62, type: 3}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: Elodie
    text: "\xA1el pueblo no puede quedarse de brazos cruzados!\r\n"
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: -279528177590649484, guid: a43165c25c2222c4f916d608d276ce9e, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 0
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 1
    shakeDuration: 0.25
    shakeIntensity: 5
    playSound: 1
    soundClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b86074ec92355cd4d81fd67ee9c6fb62, type: 3}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: 
    text: "Suspir\xE9 pesadamente, dando otro mordisco a mi manzana. Esto era algo
      confuso para m\xED, no sab\xEDa que tanto ten\xEDa el derecho a opinar.\r\n"
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: -1087421258012235777, guid: c2d09e26aef54fc4884531ebf704c0fd, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 1
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 0
    soundClip: {fileID: 0}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: Francois
    text: "Somos campesinos, no nos preocupemos tanto por eso ahora. Tengo las suficientes
      monedas para comprar un pan entero. \r\n"
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: 749445152557612188, guid: 8626c246a03ffbf4da7e963b1bf26a69, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 0
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 1
    soundClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd8dced5c1745ab4fa4203825aa83b89, type: 3}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: Elodie
    text: "\xA1Pero sale 15 libras! "
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: 5184651387025587248, guid: a0e2fdf87989cc049932ed6f5604fc02, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 0
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 1
    shakeIntensity: 2
    playSound: 1
    soundClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b86074ec92355cd4d81fd67ee9c6fb62, type: 3}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: Francois
    text: "\xBFY?"
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: -1087421258012235777, guid: c2d09e26aef54fc4884531ebf704c0fd, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 0
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 1
    soundClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd8dced5c1745ab4fa4203825aa83b89, type: 3}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: Elodie
    text: "\xA1Ganas 20 libras! Es casi toda tu paga, Fran\xE7ois."
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: 5184651387025587248, guid: a0e2fdf87989cc049932ed6f5604fc02, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 0
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0.25
    shakeIntensity: 2
    playSound: 1
    soundClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b86074ec92355cd4d81fd67ee9c6fb62, type: 3}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: Francois
    text: "No te preocupes por m\xED, tengo algunas cosechas por ahora. "
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: -1087421258012235777, guid: c2d09e26aef54fc4884531ebf704c0fd, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 0
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 1
    soundClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd8dced5c1745ab4fa4203825aa83b89, type: 3}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
    choices: []
  - speaker: Elodie
    text: "\xA1Est\xE1 bien! \xBFVamos a comprar el pan de do\xF1a Monique o vamos
      al pueblo? "
    showImage: 1
    characterImage: {fileID: 749445152557612188, guid: 8626c246a03ffbf4da7e963b1bf26a69, type: 3}
    imagePosition: 0
    characterImageSize: {x: 0, y: 0}
    mostrarImagenUI: 0
    imagenUI: {fileID: 0}
    panelType: 0
    newBackground: {fileID: 0}
    triggerShake: 0
    shakeDuration: 0
    shakeIntensity: 0
    playSound: 1
    soundClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b86074ec92355cd4d81fd67ee9c6fb62, type: 3}
    playSFX: 0
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxDuration: 0
    dispararCarruselPaneles: 0
    ocultarPanelDialogo: 0
    choicePanelType: 0
